  'Euro-Pro Kitchen Faucet — Chrome', 'Huntington Brass', 'Two setting sprayer', 'The Huntington Brass Euro-Pro pull-down kitchen faucet features sleek, modern styling highlighted by a high-arc spout and refined details that blend functionality with timeless design. Its dual-function pull-down spray head adds versatility for everyday tasks, making this kitchen faucet both a practical tool and a striking centerpiece for the kitchen.\n\nFeatures:\n• Two setting pull-down sprayer (spray or stream function).\n• 360 Degree swing angle spout.\n• Highly durable braided reinforced hose.\n• High arc spout, perfect for double sinks.\n• Can be mounted on a standard single hole sink, three hole sink or custom drilled counter top.\n• Deck plate included to cover three hole sinks.\n• Available in these finishes: Polished Chrome, PVD Satin Nickel, PVD Satin Brass and Matte Black.\n\nThis faucet can be installed on this type of sink:\n\nSpecification\nSheets\n\n• Two setting sprayer\n• Ceramic disc cartridge\n• Deck Plate Included\n• 1.8 GPM',
  302.9, NULL, 'Chrome', '091878610156',
  7.44, 9.45, 22.05, 2.56,
  'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0614/9626/2730/files/K1963401-J.jpg?v=1773261052', 'csv', 1)
