VALUES ((SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'faucets'),
  'Shower Fixtures', 'P3223199', 'p3223199',
  'Push button rough-in valve — No finish', 'Huntington Brass', 'Push button shower Rough-In Valve', 'High quality forged brass rough-in shower valve with built-in double push button diverter valve. The Huntington Brass push button diverter rough-in shower valve will allow you to switch between the shower and accessory with a push of the button or push both buttons for the complete shower experience. This rough-in valve opens the design possibilities to use many different types of bath accessories from an extra showerhead to a multi setting hand shower for the complete spa shower.\n\nFeatures:\n• Two button, two port diverter outlet\n• Back to back installation.\n• High quality forged brass shower valve and diverter body.\n• Service stops located on each side of the valve for local water supply shut off.\n• Adjustable hot temperature anti-scald limit stop.\n• Completely rebuildable with replaceable ceramic disc pressure balance cartridge, push button cartridges and service stops.\n• Rough-in mud guard included with this valve.\n• Multiple anchor points to secure valve to inside of wall.\n• Both buttons can be pressed on simultaneously.\n\nSpecification\nSheet\nInstallation\nInstructions\n\n• Push button shower Rough-In Valve\n• Two port outlet\n• 110°Turn ceramic disc cartridge\n• Pressure balanced valve\n• Forged brass valve body withintegral stops\n• Universal ﬁttings (1/2” CC & 1/2” IPS)\n• ASSE 1016 compliant',
  249.9, NULL, 'No finish', '091878575929',
