  'Shower Fixtures', 'P3323199', 'p3323199',
  'Push button rough-in valve — No finish', 'Huntington Brass', 'Pending', 'Push Button Rough-in Pressure Balance Shower Mixing Valve.\nHigh quality forged brass rough-in shower valve with built-in push button diverter valve. The Huntington Brass push button diverter rough-in shower valve will allow you to switch between the shower and multiple accessories with a push of the button. This rough-in valve opens the design possibilities to use many different types of bath accessories from an extra showerhead to a multi setting hand shower for the complete spa shower.\n\nFeatures:\n• Three button, three port outlet.\n• Back to back installation.\n• High quality forged brass valve and diverter body.\n• Service stops located on each side of the valve for local water supply shut off.\n• Adjustable hot temperature anti-scald limit stop.\n• Completely rebuildable with replaceable ceramic disc pressure balance cartridge, push button cartridges and service stops.\n• Rough-in mud guard included.\n• Multiple anchor points to secure valve to inside of wall.\n• All buttons can be pressed on simultaneously.\n\n• Due to the valves flow restrictions and depending on your application it might not be recommended to use all three buttons at the same time.\n\nSpecification\nSheet\nInstallation\nInstructions\n\n• Pending',
