  'Builder Shower rough-in valve — No finish', 'Huntington Brass', 'Ceramic disc cartridge', 'Huntington Brass Builder rough-in shower mixing valve with four anchor points and universal ½” fittings for quick and easy installation. The Huntington Brass pressure balance valve comes complete with cartridge and everything to install without delays. Only thing left to do is finish the shower with the many choices of shower trim kits which are sold separately.\n\nFeatures:\n• Brass valve body with built in hot and cold service stops for water supply shut-off.\n• Can be mounted in back to back installations.\n• Adjustable hot temperature anti-scald limit stop for safety and security.\n• Easy replaceable ceramic disc cartridge with built in pressure balance.\n• Mud guard included.\n• Finish shower trim kits sold separately.\n• High quality all brass construction.\n• Crimp style PEX B fittings\n\n• 1" Extension kit is available for this item (P0153199)\n\n10 year limited warranty on all Builder Series Items.\n\n*Minimum order of 12 pieces per SKU is required to qualify for discounts on all Builder Series items. Contact customer service for details.\n\n\n\nSpecification\nSheet\n\n• Ceramic disc cartridge\n• Pressure balanced valve\n• Brass valve body\n• PEX ﬁttings\n• ASSE 1016 compliant',
  124.9, NULL, 'No finish', '091878610194',
  2.99, 5.98, 5.98, 4.53,
