  'Trend Roman Tub Filler — Chrome', 'Huntington Brass', 'With handshower', 'Huntington Brass Trend four-piece roman bathtub filler faucet with pull-out single setting hand shower. Contemporary styling to add a high-end style to your bathroom along with the durable metal construction. High quality, high arc spout to ensure the high-volume water that will fill the bathtub as fast as possible along with the life long lasting ceramic disc cartridges will give you a worry and leak free faucet for many years.\n\nFeatures:\n• Single setting pull-out hand shower.\n• Lift diverter knob built into roman tub spout.\n• 90 Degree turn lever handles.\n• 1/2" Valves with replaceable ceramic disc cartridges.\n• High quality high arc spout.\n• Available in three finishes: Polished Chrome, Satin Nickel and Matte Black.\n\nSpecification\nSheets\n\n• With handshower\n• Ceramic disc cartridges\n• Quick connect spout\n• 1/2” NPS connections\n• 10 GPM\n• 1.5 GPM Hand shower',
