VALUES ((SELECT id FROM categories WHERE slug = 'faucets'),
  'Tub Fillers', 'S7424701-7', 's7424701-7',
  'Tub Filler — Chrome', 'Huntington Brass', 'With hand shower', 'The elegant thermostatic Roman tub filler with hand shower offers a refined blend of performance and modern design for today’s bathroom. Featuring a sleek high-arc spout and a coordinated hand shower, this four-piece tub filler is designed to complement a wide range of bathroom styles. The thermostatic control maintains a consistent water temperature for added comfort and safety, while the integrated diverter allows for easy switching between the tub spout and hand shower. With its balanced design and smooth operation, this Roman tub filler creates a luxurious bathing experience while adding a sophisticated finishing touch to the space.\n\nFeatures:\nThermostatic Tub Filler\n• Diverter valve for switching between spout and hand shower.\n• Light weight ABS pull-out hand shower.\n• 59" Long hand shower hose.\n• High flow valves included with this roman faucet.\n• Replaceable cartridges that can be serviced from the top of the valve.\n• 3/4” NPS connections\n• 18 GPM\n• 1.5 GPM Hand shower\n• Available in Three finishes: Polished Chrome, Satin Nickel, and Matte Black.\n\nSpecification\nSheets\nInstallation\nInstructions\n\n• With hand shower\n• Thermostatic cartridge\n• Quick connect spout\n• 18 GPM\n• 1.5 GPM Hand shower',
  987.9, NULL, 'Chrome', '091878610095',
  11.62, 12.6, 21.06, 3.15,
