  'Tub Fillers', 'S7860701', 's7860701',
  'Euro Tub Filler — Chrome', 'Huntington Brass', 'Floor mounted roman tub ﬁller', 'The Euro freestanding tub filler faucet offers a sleek, beautiful statement in minimalist design. The Euro’s sleek curved spout, single setting hand shower and minimalist details tied together to complement a wide range of design possibilities in modern styling to create a bold symbol in any contemporary bathroom.\n\nFeatures:\n• High-arc minimalist spout design.\n• Single function hand shower.\n• Pivoting hand shower holder to point hand shower to desired angle.\n• Easy to turn handle.\n• Diverter knob to switch between spout and hand shower.\n• 360 Degree swiveling spout with permanent lock in position adjustment.\n• Replaceable long lasting ceramic disc cartridge.\n• 8 GPM @ 60 PSI\n• Available in four finishes: Polished Chrome, PVD Satin Nickel, PVD Satin Brass and Matte Black.\n\nSpecification\nSheet\nInstallation\nInstructions\n\n• Floor mounted roman tub ﬁller\n• Single setting hand shower\n• Ceramic disc cartridge\n• Swiveling spout\n• Pivoting hand shower holder\n• 8 GPM @ 60 PSI\n• 1.5 GPM Hand shower',
